# README language

Write and edit `README.md` in English.

- Headings, instructions, and player-facing text go in English.
- When changing a section that is not in English, translate that section to English in the same edit.
- Chat replies stay in the user's language. This rule applies only to README content.

## Examples

```markdown
<!-- ❌ BAD -->
## Como usar

Pressione **Shift + V** para mostrar o veículo.

<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
## How to use

Press **Shift + V** to show the vehicle.
```
